  "worked_solution": "We factor the numerator and denominator, canceling out any common factors that appear in both.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{a}^{2}-4a+4}{{a}^{2}-4} & =\\frac{(a-2)^{2}}{(a-2)(a+2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{(a-2)\\cancel{(a-2)}}{\\cancel{(a-2)}(a+2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{a-2}{a+2}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
